{"id":"chatcmpl-89fdf5ea-96a4-4da5-bfd8-fe0fbe55cf0b","object":"chat.completion","created":1795229848,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task demonstrates a multi-model consensus approach for medical image interpretation, where specialized and general vision-language models are queried independently and their agreement is used as evidence. A verification step is inserted before committing to an answer, and targeted region-of-interest zooming is used to resolve spatial/laterality ambiguity. The pattern generalizes to any visual QA task where spatial orientation or laterality is error-prone and multiple model opinions can be cross-checked.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"Query two or more independent models with the same targeted question and treat consistent agreement as stronger evidence than a single model's output.\",\n    \"Insert an explicit verification step before finalizing, especially when the task involves spatial reasoning (laterality, orientation) that is known to be error-prone.\",\n    \"When a marker or orientation cue exists in the image, explicitly reference it in the query to anchor the model's spatial reasoning.\",\n    \"Use region-of-interest cropping/zooming to visually inspect ambiguous structures before committing to a spatial judgment.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging QA\": \"Ask specialized and general models the same laterality/orientation question; require agreement before answering; zoom into the relevant anatomy when markers or projection geometry could mislead.\",\n    \"Spatial/laterality reasoning tasks\": \"Anchor queries to explicit orientation markers (e.g., 'L' marker), warn models about projection artifacts, and verify with a zoomed crop of the region of interest.\",\n    \"Multi-model consensus tasks\": \"Collect independent opinions, note agreement/conflict, and only finalize when no contradictory visual evidence exists; document the reasoning for the chosen answer.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm at least two independent model outputs agree on the key finding before answering.\",\n    \"Verify the spatial claim against the image's orientation marker and a zoomed view of the relevant region.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":842,"total_tokens":1236,"completion_tokens":394,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":842},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":394}}}